class_name Maps
extends RefCounted
## ASCII level maps. One character per 32 px tile.
##
## Ground (lowercase and punctuation):
##   .  base floor      ,  alt floor      :  path        *  decor A    o  decor B
##   =  stones / log    ~  water (solid)  _  shoreline   k  rock tile (solid in forest)
## Entities (uppercase and symbols, placed on base floor unless entity_ground says otherwise):
##   T larch  P pine  B boulder  Q bush  Y tall grass
##   G ger    J small ger   E enemy ger   F campfire   H haystack   L hitching line
##   O ovoo   N banner      C cart        I torch      Z fence rail  V fence rail (vertical)
##   S sheep  U horse
##   + ger and # small ger that only appear once "growth" says the camp has enough tails
##   M Hoelun (talk)   W swordsman   A archer   & hunter   $ dog
##   K Begter (boss)   % Targhutai (boss)
##   R roots pickup    X fish pickup
##   @ default spawn   1-9 exits, paired with the same digit on the target map

